          "type": "text",
          "text": "Ethiopic script font designed in a handwritten style.\n\nThe Geʾez Handwriting Out Arr Rule regular typeface applies directional arrows to the to the outline style to indicate stroke direction and adds writing guides (\"rules\") as would be found in a notebook.\n\nThis font is part of a collection of 14 typefaces developed to help teach handwriting to children.\n\nProject Homepage: https://github.com/raeytype/geez-handwriting-fonts"
        }
      ]
    }
